{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49072","headline":"巫山一段云 一 · 昭宗皇帝","name":"巫山一段云 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缥缈云间质，盈盈波上身。\n袖罗斜举动埃尘，明艳不胜春。\n翠鬓晚妆烟重，寂寂阳台一梦。\n冰眸莲脸见长新，巫峡更何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"昭宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49072.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49072","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}